<h1>Verify your email</h1>
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>Click the button below to verify your email address. This link expires in <strong>24 hours</strong>.</p>

<p style="text-align:center;margin:28px 0;">
  <a class="btn" href="{{verifyUrl}}">Verify Email Address</a>
</p>

<p style="font-size:13px;color:#555;">Or copy and paste this URL into your browser:</p>
<p class="code" style="word-break:break-all;font-size:12px;">{{verifyUrl}}</p>

<hr class="divider" />
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#555;">If you didn't create a GateML account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
